Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:07.02,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx49\pos(35,285)\fad(531,513)}BOND'S STRATEGY TO STAY ALIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:06.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Peak laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:08.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:12.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,you'll get in trouble with your teacher \Nif you don't do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.00,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(135,95)\c&H000002&\blur2\fs20\fad(278,475)}Bond's Special Power\N{\fs24} Precognition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek time with Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.30,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:43.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Eek! The power went out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.81,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I have a surprise for you, Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:04.04,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,130)}Guy from the Research Lab
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:03.20,main,Researcher,0,0,0,,I'm finally found you, Number 8!\NNow you'll have to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:05.53,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:37.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You mustn't cry. He lived \Na happy life in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:48.61,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What? You want to say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:49.35,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:56.34,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.89,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is busy with homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:11.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Bond. We were out of \Ndog food, but I forgot to buy more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:14.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I think Loid is going to be \Nhome late tonight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:18.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll try to make your dinner with \Nwhat we have around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:19.42,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Bond! Your dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:31.32,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:39.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.34,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\bord4\3c&HF4F7F7&}Cause of Death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:47.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid was kind enough to make a list of all the\N things dogs can't eat, so it should be simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:52.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Your dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.82,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(50,105,-240,105,1281,1510)\c&H000000&\3c&HFBFDFC&\fs30\fad(446,1)}Resolution!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:58.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you make Mama angry, \Nshe'll kill you, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:06.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well, he just wouldn't \Neat the dinner I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:14.08,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\3c&HD6DDDC&\blur2\bord3}It{\alphaFF\t(527,528,\alpha00)}'s {\alphaFF\t(1027,1028,\alpha00)}ov{\alphaFF\t(1528,1529,\alpha00)}er
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:20.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Come now, Bond. You mustn't get all riled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.60,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\move(370,140,-260,140,1781,2010)\c&H437B40&\fsp6}is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.60,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\move(305,140,-320,140,1865,2090)\c&H4834B6&\fsp5\fad(80,1)}will make dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.60,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\bord1.5\3c&HE7EAE7&\c&H000401&}Death
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.77,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\move(335,140,-280,140,1781,2080)\c&H437B40&\fsp}comes home early
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.77,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\move(360,110,-200,110,1865,2090)\c&H437B40&\fsp2\fad(80,1)}will make dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:40.11,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H091417&\fs40\bord0\fad(735,1)}Survival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.11,0:03:45.03,sign_1413_13_Guy_from_the_Res,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\an4\fad(1,500)}Work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:44.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Bond! What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks for finishing it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now I can go home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:58.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:00.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.17,main,Child being held by mother,0,0,0,,Doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.32,main,Shop owner,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.90,main,Shop owner,0,0,0,,Where'd this stray come from? Shoo, shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:33.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,How dare you get food \Nelsewhere?! You bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.97,main,Child A,0,0,0,,A dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:56.70,main,Child B,0,0,0,,Draw eyebrows on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:50.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,My mission tonight is to obtain \Na sample of the truth serum
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:52.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,being developed by \NBorn Industries, Gerrulimus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:57.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,As usual, this was a tall order, so I didn't \Nhave time to gather any information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.41,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Go, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I won't be able to infiltrate \Nthe premises with a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll just have to force my way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.46,top,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:08.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What?! Bond?! What's he doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:11.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Quiet down! The enemy will find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait, is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:17.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Where are Yor and Anya? Did you \Nget away from them during a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going \Non here, but go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:22.13,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm working right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:23.39,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:26.40,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf, borf, borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What? You want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:30.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm busy right now. It'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:32.29,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf! Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, come back here! \NThe enemy base is that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:40.45,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's leading me down a \Nroute that's deserted?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't remember training him to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:44.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did he learn that prior?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:49.23,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, there were rumors that \NBorn Industries was involved in Project Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:52.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you come here because you knew that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you trying to do this for your... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get revenge for your \Nfriends who were experimented on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.72,main,Bond,0,0,0,,B... Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. Let's get through \Nour missions together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Since I lack information, \Nrelying on your nose is my best option!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:08.47,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:25.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So this must be the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:26.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There are safes everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Which one has Gerrulimus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:36.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Their security's tight, so it'll be tough \Nto go through each one separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:39.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Who knows when I'll get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.49,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,Why'd we get called back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:47.65,main,Staff B,0,0,0,,Apparently, they found a defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Shit! They're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:53.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll keep the enemy busy. \NYou head back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is going to be a long battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.62,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Bo-borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:08:00.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Where in the world were you?\N Now eat your dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:04.37,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf! Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:08.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? Don't worry. Most of the staff \Nhas clocked out for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:10.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:20.03,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,Damn that chief. Why'd we\N get called back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:22.37,main,Staff B,0,0,0,,Apparently, they found a defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:25.27,main,Staff C,0,0,0,,Our delivery date moved up, \Ntoo. Give us a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:28.57,main,Staff B,0,0,0,,Stop complaining. We're getting \Npressured from high up, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.31,main,Staff B,0,0,0,,The door's unlocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.19,main,Staff D,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.20,main,Staff D,0,0,0,,"T. Bandit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:41.83,main,Staff D,0,0,0,,Who's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.55,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:50.33,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,What the hell? It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:52.67,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,Damn it. Who pulled this prank—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks... for opening that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:02.92,main,Staff A,0,0,0,,Wh-Who the hell are you guys?! S-Someone—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Not bad. Thanks to you, \NI completed my mission smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now I can go home earlier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:24.75,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:29.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Goodness, you had me so worried. \NI looked for you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:40.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. You're that happy that you were \Nable to get back at Born Industries?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:46.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. Let's stop by the supermarket on \Nour way home so I can cook you a special meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:47.68,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf! Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:56.11,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx58\pos(35,75)\fad(531,513)\an7}DAMIAN'S FIELD RESEARCH TRIP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.96,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, if you don't hurry and \Nwake up, you'll be late to roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.94,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,As punishment for being late to roll call, \Nyou are to help the Dorm Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:20.01,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Until then, you are prohibited \Nfrom leaving the dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:23.22,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,This is quite rare for you. \NThough it is not a school day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:27.86,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,it is not elegant to live a \Nslovenly lifestyle, Mr. Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.27,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'll be more careful, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:38.12,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, were you up late studying again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.05,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I need to hurry up and earn more Stellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.10,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You're working way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:48.27,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Oh, also! I hear our teacher is going \Nto take us to the movies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:51.37,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,We might get to see the new \N{\i1}20,000 Steps under the Sea{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.74,main,Emil,0,0,0,,And on our way back, we're going \Nto have roast beef at Wimpsons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.66,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Let's finish up so we can \Nmeet up with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.89,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Yay, roast beef!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:59.14,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:01.28,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm going to be studying in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:04.07,main,Emil,0,0,0,,What? But it's our day off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:06.25,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I said I'm not going. \NI'm not changing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:07.59,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:11.60,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Sir, can we go see whatever movie we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.93,main,Student B,0,0,0,,I want to see {\i1}20,000 Steps under the Sea{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:16.71,main,Tutor,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:20.97,top,Student B,0,0,0,,Come on, please? We should definitely \Nsee {\i1}20,000 Steps under the Sea{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.42,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm not like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:24.61,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,While they're busy playing, I'm going \Nto work hard to get to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:30.62,flashback,Desmond,0,0,0,,Damian, continue working hard \Nso as not to shame the Desmond name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.73,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,So Father will praise me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.27,main,Dorm Mother,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:39.00,main,Dorm Mother,0,0,0,,Go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.71,main,Dorm Mother,0,0,0,,This is Damian's penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:03.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Improper dress and eating \Noutside of designated hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:07.00,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,As punishment, go help the Dorm Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.75,main,Emil and Ewen,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:13.57,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.59,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here? Why didn't \Nyou go out with the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:17.45,main,Emil,0,0,0,,This is our punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:19.18,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:21.45,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I said that I'm not going to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:23.13,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Stop being so stubborn, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:24.30,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.30,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Whatever. You don't need to hang out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:30.15,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You two go on and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:40.09,main,Emil,0,0,0,,I mean, if you really think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:43.73,main,Emil,0,0,0,,those other guys lack any taste if they're \Ngoing to a movie on a beautiful day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:46.83,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Exactly. What's really in \Nright now is doing laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.41,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Not to mention, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:54.17,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,We can even pretend to be Imperial Scholars!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:58.55,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,If you want your Stellas, come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.38,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey! That cape belongs to me, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.91,main,Dorm Mother,0,0,0,,Come back here and work, you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.19,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Elegant...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:09.26,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your friendship... preciously elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:24.92,main,Green,0,0,0,,You look like you want to go on a picnic, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.39,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:28.54,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:31.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Talking and messing around while \Nyou're supposed to be working...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:34.29,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I have a new punishment for you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.03,main,Damian; Emil; Ewen,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:39.78,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Go on the field research trip \Nwith Mr. Green, our custos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.63,main,Green,0,0,0,,Aren't picnics fun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:46.79,top,Emil,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:48.92,main,Green,0,0,0,,You can go down the river \Nwhile being on the premises!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.93,main,Green,0,0,0,,Isn't Eden grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.31,top,Ewen,0,0,0,,We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.54,top,Emil,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:55.37,main,Green,0,0,0,,Don't you worry. I used to be in the navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:58.12,main,Green,0,0,0,,Just relax and have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:02.15,main,Green,0,0,0,,All right! Let's keep going \Nuntil we hit the lake upstream!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.03,main,Green,0,0,0,,It's a great spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.27,main,Green,0,0,0,,Moderate exercise is good for the brain, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:10.52,main,Green,0,0,0,,Just sitting at your desk isn't necessarily \Nthe most effective way to study!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:12.02,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Well, this exercise isn't moderate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:15.29,main,Green,0,0,0,,Come on, lads! You're going to have \Nto row to the left as hard as you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:16.92,main,Green,0,0,0,,or we're going to crash into that rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:22.75,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Sir! There's a waterfall \Nright in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:32.84,main,Emil and Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:37.05,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.05,0:14:39.01,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm the second son of the \Nprestigious Desmond family!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:40.38,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,We're coming right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.52,main,Green,0,0,0,,Hey, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.78,main,Emil,0,0,0,,I'm the heir to the Elman family!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.02,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I'm the successor to the Egeburg fam—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:49.16,main,Emil,0,0,0,,L-Lord Damian, you need to survive, \Neven if no one else can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:52.54,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Yes! Make your dreams come \Ntrue for our sakes, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:53.87,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:57.28,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Please hurry to the boat! Before \Nthe last of our strength fails us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.67,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.28,main,Green,0,0,0,,I can see you're having fun out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.61,main,Green,0,0,0,,but you can stand up. \NAnd the current isn't fast at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:04.46,main,Damian; Emil; Ewen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.47,main,Green,0,0,0,,It was only fast because I was paddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:20.60,main,Green,0,0,0,,Come on. You need to get some firewood \Nso we can start a fire before you catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.47,main,Damian; Emil; Ewen,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.53,main,Damian,0,0,0,,It's so warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.82,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Now that I've calmed down, I'm kinda hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:39.29,main,Green,0,0,0,,Since you're wet already, \Nwhy don't we catch fish in the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.25,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,What? We don't have sandwiches \Nor anything prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.64,main,Green,0,0,0,,We don't have anything fancy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:47.12,main,Green,0,0,0,,You're Eden students!\NWe'll get what we need right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.76,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:52.33,main,Green,0,0,0,,I'll get you some string and nets.\NYou figure out the best way to use them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.21,main,Damian; Emil; Ewen,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.37,main,Damian,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:16:59.55,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.23,main,Green,0,0,0,,Ain't it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:04.08,main,Green,0,0,0,,The roast beef at Wimpsons ain't half bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.20,main,Green,0,0,0,,but nothing beats prey \Nyou've caught yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.69,main,Emil,0,0,0,,It's good! It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:10.12,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.63,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Why am I having fun right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:17.64,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,While I'm messing around here, \Nothers are studying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:24.97,main,Green,0,0,0,,Doesn't the gentle breeze feel nice, lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.10,main,Green,0,0,0,,The sound of the fire popping\N as the flames dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.91,main,Green,0,0,0,,The rustling of the trees and \Nthe smell of the dirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:39.40,main,Green,0,0,0,,Relaxing and letting your five senses\N take control ain't half bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:43.53,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I won't become an Imperial Scholar \Njust by spacing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:47.57,main,Green,0,0,0,,Oh? Did you know that the most \Nrecent studies in neuroscience
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:51.50,main,Green,0,0,0,,suggest that your brain feels really \Nrevitalized when you're spacing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.81,0:17:55.78,main,Green,0,0,0,,Apparently, it affects your \Nmemory and imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:18:01.50,main,Green,0,0,0,,So famous creators and athletes make sure \Nto give themselves time to space out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:06.40,main,Green,0,0,0,,While you're spacing out, you might be able \Nto get all eight Stellas before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.69,main,Emil,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.37,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Space out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:20.88,top,Damian,0,0,0,,Space out, space out, space out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:18.05,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, I don't think \Nthat's really spacing out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.42,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,He might be more simple-minded than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:24.00,main,Green,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:28.67,main,Green,0,0,0,,Your clothes have mostly dried, \Nso let's walk toward the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:34.30,main,Green,0,0,0,,Apparently, the students call \Nthis lake "Stella Lake."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.70,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Stella! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.26,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, you're way \Ntoo obsessed with Stellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:42.51,main,Green,0,0,0,,Pic-pic-pic-pic-picnic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:47.09,main,Green,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Lately, people in the south \Nhave been using the code word "picnic"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:50.66,main,Green,0,0,0,,for defecting to the West \Nthrough a third country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:54.42,main,Damian; Emil; Ewen,0,0,0,,Sir, are you trying to sell us to the West?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:58.78,main,Green,0,0,0,,You can't defect just by walking \Na couple of kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.08,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I wonder why they go to the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.86,main,Emil,0,0,0,,I wonder if snacks just \Ntaste better in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.60,main,Green,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:09.57,main,Green,0,0,0,,Just look at how beautiful \Nthe night sky is in Ostania.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.70,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:16.25,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Once Lord Damian becomes an adult, \Nhe'll make Ostania even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:16.71,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.52,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:21.29,main,Green,0,0,0,,Oh? Do you wish to be a politician \Nin the future? That's admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:23.80,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Well, my father is one, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:29.68,main,Green,0,0,0,,I see, yes. It's wonderful to be \Nable to work hard toward a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:32.59,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,By the way, my dream is to \Nbecome a cosmonaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.59,main,Green,0,0,0,,Is it? Well, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.35,main,Emil,0,0,0,,I, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.91,0:19:38.17,main,Emil,0,0,0,,don't really have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.31,main,Green,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't, eh? \NWell, that's perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:43.47,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Actually, I want to live my \Nlife eating lots of snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:45.94,main,Green,0,0,0,,Splendid! Now, what kind of dream is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:50.68,main,Green,0,0,0,,You'll have to think earnestly about \Nhow to make that possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:54.31,main,Green,0,0,0,,How are you going to stay healthy\N even if you're eating a lot of snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:55.71,main,Emil,0,0,0,,What? That sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:19:59.71,main,Green,0,0,0,,And we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:20.86,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Wow! The stars are reflecting on the \Nwater! It looks like the universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:25.01,main,Green,0,0,0,,Look, lads. It's almost as if \Nyou can grab the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:26.25,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.80,main,Green,0,0,0,,Do you think we wasted our time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:33.76,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.88,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I think it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:40.62,main,Green,0,0,0,,Right... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:42.34,main,Green,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.45,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,The universe is so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:20:59.86,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:04.50,main,Emil,0,0,0,,The stars look so yummy, \Nlike sugar spread all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.96,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.91,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.67,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Whatever, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:16.55,main,Green,0,0,0,,Hey, we're gonna start heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:19.35,main,Green,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. This was supposed \Nto be a field research trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.97,main,Green,0,0,0,,Make sure you three write reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:26.17,main,Dmian,0,0,0,,Ugh... Once we get back, I just \Nwant to shower and go right to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:28.55,main,Green,0,0,0,,That sounds very healthy, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:31.05,main,Green,0,0,0,,Master Henderson...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:35.04,main,Green,0,0,0,,I've brought the boys' \Nfield research reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:37.39,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:39.79,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Were they able to spread their wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:42.05,main,Green,0,0,0,,I hope they felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:44.81,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Quite elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:48.81,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,We saw a lot and did a \Nbunch of stuff. It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:52.19,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,But we'll have to work on his spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.93,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(385,220)\fscx50}MISSION AND FAMILY\N{\fscx80} THE ELEGANT BONDMAN\N{\fscx50} THE HEART OF A CHILD/WAKING UP
